{"id":50217,"date":"2026-03-28T07:29:31","date_gmt":"2026-03-28T06:29:31","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/grande-trail-serra-darga-2026\/"},"modified":"2026-10-05T11:42:22","modified_gmt":"2026-10-05T10:42:22","slug":"grande-trail-serra-darga","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/grande-trail-serra-darga\/","title":{"rendered":"Grande Trail Serra D\u2019Arga 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Grande Trail Serra D\u2019Arga 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Grande Trail Serra D\u2019Arga 2026<\/strong> (GTSA) realiza-se de <strong>02 a 04 de Outubro de 2026<\/strong> no cen\u00e1rio selvagem e m\u00edstico da <strong>Serra d&#8217;Arga<\/strong>, cruzando os concelhos de Caminha, Viana do Castelo e Ponte de Lima. Organizado pela prestigiada Carlos S\u00e1 Nature Events, o evento \u00e9 uma refer\u00eancia incontorn\u00e1vel do trail running ib\u00e9rico.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Com centro nevr\u00e1lgico na emblem\u00e1tica aldeia de <strong>Dem (Caminha)<\/strong> e partida da prova rainha na hist\u00f3rica <strong>Pra\u00e7a da Rep\u00fablica em Viana do Castelo<\/strong>, o programa acolhe desde a desafiante <strong>Ultra 100 km (4443m D+)<\/strong> e a cl\u00e1ssica <strong>Ultra 50 km (2531m D+)<\/strong> at\u00e9 ao <strong>Trail Longo 31 km<\/strong>, <strong>Trail Curto 17 km e 15 km<\/strong>, al\u00e9m da <strong>Caminhada 12 km<\/strong> e do animado GTSA Kids.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o da <strong>Carlos S\u00e1 Nature Events<\/strong> assegura bases de vida completas, balne\u00e1rios, controlo eletr\u00f3nico de tempos com live tracking, refei\u00e7\u00e3o p\u00f3s-prova em Dem e toda a atmosfera calorosa do acolhimento minhoto nas montanhas do Alto Minho.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-si