n><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada GTSA 12 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 04 Out \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:00 \u2022 350m D+<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">At\u00e9 01\/08:<\/strong> 20.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 01\/08)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 2:<\/strong> 25.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (02\/08 a 25\/08)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">\u00daltima Fase:<\/strong> 30.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (26\/08 a 25\/09)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o Grande Trail Serra D\u2019Arga 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento realiza-se de 02 a 04 de Outubro de 2026. A partida dos 100 km decorre na Pra\u00e7a da Rep\u00fablica em Viana do Castelo, os 15 km partem de Montaria e as restantes dist\u00e2ncias t\u00eam partida e chegada na aldeia de Dem, Caminha.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias dispon\u00edveis no GTSA 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O programa integra o GTSA 100 km, GTSA 50 km, GTSA 31 km, GTSA 17 km, GTSA 15 km, a Caminhada de 12 km e a corrida infanto-juvenil GTSA Kids.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso consultar o regulamento oficial da prova?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O regulamento oficial completo com barreiras hor\u00e1rias, lista de material obrigat\u00f3rio e abastecimentos est\u00e1 dispon\u00edvel para consulta direta na ficha t\u00e9cnica do evento no portal Portugal Running.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como funciona o secretariado e levantamento de dorsais?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O levantamento de dorsais funciona na sexta-feira em Viana do Castelo (Pra\u00e7a da Rep\u00fablica) e no s\u00e1bado e domingo junto \u00e0 Igreja Paroquial de Dem nos hor\u00e1rios regulamentares.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que inclui o valor de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o no GTSA?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui dorsal com chip, seguro de acidentes pessoais, medalha de finalista, brinde oficial, abastecimentos s\u00f3lidos e l\u00edquidos, banhos quentes e almo\u00e7o de encerramento (conforme a dist\u00e2ncia).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Grande Trail Serra D\u2019Arga 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-10-02\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Largo da Igreja Paroquial de Dem \/ Pra\u00e7a da Rep\u00fablica\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Caminha\", \"addressRegion\": \"Viana do Castelo\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Carlos S\u00e1 Nature Events\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza o Grande Trail Serra D\u2019Arga 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento realiza-se de 02 a 04 de Outubro de 2026. A partida dos 100 km decorre na Pra\u00e7a da Rep\u00fablica em Viana do Castelo, os 15 km partem de Montaria e as restantes dist\u00e2ncias t\u00eam partida e chegada na aldeia de Dem, Caminha.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias dispon\u00edveis no GTSA 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O programa integra o GTSA 100 km, GTSA 50 km, GTSA 31 km, GTSA 17 km, GTSA 15 km, a Caminhada de 12 km e a corrida infanto-juvenil GTSA Kids.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde posso consultar o regulamento oficial da prova?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O regulamento oficial completo com barreiras hor\u00e1rias, lista de material obrigat\u00f3rio e abastecimentos est\u00e1 dispon\u00edvel para consulta direta na ficha t\u00e9cnica do evento no portal Portugal Running.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Como funciona o secretariado e levantamento de dorsais?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O levantamento de dorsais funciona na sexta-feira em Viana do Castelo (Pra\u00e7a da Rep\u00fablica) e no s\u00e1bado e domingo junto \u00e0 Igreja Paroquial de Dem nos hor\u00e1rios regulamentares.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"O que inclui o valor de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o no GTSA?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui dorsal com chip, seguro de acidentes pessoais, medalha de finalista, brinde oficial, abastecimentos s\u00f3lidos e l\u00edquidos, banhos quentes e almo\u00e7o de encerramento (conforme a dist\u00e2ncia).\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":67865,"m